emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布MAI-Transcribe-2语音识别模型，每小时转写费用仅0.10美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式发布GPT-6 Astra大模型，多项基准测试实现性能领跑</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google Workspace全线接入Gemini语音交互功能，支持Gmail、Docs与Keep</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里千问办公上线首月用户破3000万并开源企业上下文基础设施MyContext</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cef188670e7b6d944c825255d07c787.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里旗下AI办公产品“千问办公”（QwenWork）上线首月用户突破3000万，其中企业用户占比超50%。该产品在30天内完成120个版本迭代，并正式开源企业上下文基础设施MyContext，旨在将IM、文档、审批及邮件等异构数据转化为Agent可调用的上下文，目前GitHub已获3000余Star。技术层面，千问办公联合千问大模型团队推出办公专属模型Qwen3.8-Flash，针对多步规划与上下文压缩优化，实现单任务生成速度提升约100%，Token消耗降低75%。通过与钉钉深度打通，Agent可跨CRM、ERP等系统执行复杂业务操作。目前，长安汽车、汇付天下、老乡鸡等企业已接入使用。以长安汽车为例，线束选型计算时间从两天缩短至5分钟，显著提升了企业核心业务的自动化处理效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源 Personal AI Router 软件，实现局域网内 AI 算力调度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce8205aaeca0cbb826530bca9ea0783a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式开源 Personal AI Router（PAIR）测试版，旨在通过局域网自动发现并调度本地 AI 请求，将多台设备组成算力小队。该软件支持 M4 及以上版本 Mac、英伟达 RTX PC 及 DGX Spark，为 Ollama 和 LM Studio 等本地 AI 工具提供统一请求入口。PAIR 的核心机制是并发负载分担，当某台设备繁忙时，系统会自动将任务转向其他空闲设备，无需用户为每台机器单独配置。英伟达演示显示，在运行 Qwen 3.6 35B A3B 模型时，通过将任务拆分给 5 个 AI 子智能体，任务完成时间可从单机运行的 18 分钟缩短至 8 分 48 秒。该工具主要解决多任务并发处理效率问题，而非提升单次 AI 回复的响应速度，为开发者和本地 AI 用户提供了高效的分布式算力管理方</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布MAI-Transcribe-2语音识别模型，每小时转写费用仅0.10美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dcccbb1de732850c95df1cb1ed56696f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于9月3日正式发布新一代语音识别模型MAI-Transcribe-2。该模型在FLEURS基准测试中实现5.2%的平均词错误率（WER），在Artificial Analysis排行榜位列第二。性能方面，其长音频处理速度最高可达竞争对手的10倍，处理1小时音频仅需约10秒。MAI-Transcribe-2集成说话人分割、词级时间戳、关键词偏好及自动语言识别等功能，支持印式英语、西英混合语等语码转换，并具备高抗噪性能。开发者可在“逐字转录”与“精简转录”间切换，适配法律、临床及字幕等高合规场景。目前模型已在Microsoft Foundry、MAI Playground及Open Router上线，并提供每小时0.10美元的限时优惠价。该产品的推出通过优化准确率与延迟的帕累托前沿，显著降低了多语言音频的部署门</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式发布GPT-6 Astra大模型，多项基准测试实现性能领跑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96a1bae977b7f3e2593c5df65697f51c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于9月3日正式发布前沿大模型GPT-6 Astra，标志着行业迈入AGI时代。该模型在软件工程、科学研究及网络安全领域实现代际飞跃，是首个达到OpenAI“准备框架”关键网络安全能力阈值的模型。性能方面，Astra在ARC-AGI-3测试中取得98.6%的得分，在FrontierMath Tier4(v2)中得分97.6%，并在GPQA Diamond、DeepSWE v1.1等测试中全面领先。安全层面，Astra配备了全新的监控功能，能更可靠地拒绝有害网络请求。目前，该模型已向OpenAI Daybreak项目的企业网络安全客户开放，未来几天将陆续面向ChatGPT Plus、Pro、Business及Enterprise订阅用户推出。定价为每百万输入代币10美元、每百万输出代币50美元。Astr</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google Workspace全线接入Gemini语音交互功能，支持Gmail、Docs与Keep</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/78c90a94a5f5aa0dd7f69497187c4572.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google Workspace近日宣布全线接入Gemini语音交互功能，深度整合至Gmail、Google Docs和Google Keep三大核心产品，旨在通过自然语言对话替代传统手动输入。在Google Docs中，用户可通过语音指令实时创建、编辑文档，并支持跨应用调用Google Drive资料及多任务处理。Gmail引入深度优化语音交互，用户可直接询问航班、预约等信息，系统自动扫描并提炼邮件内容，将收件箱转化为可语音调用的智能知识库。Google Keep则利用AI深度理解能力，将口述的零散想法自动转录并整理为结构化笔记或待办清单。谷歌首席执行官桑达尔·皮查伊表示，该功能实现了从初稿生成到精细润色的全流程语音操作。此次更新标志着语音输入从单一转录工具向复杂任务处理Agent的演进，推动AI技术在生产力</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
